ተዼራቲ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ከዸትናኮ ና ዸገእ፤","poem":2},{"text":"ወረ ነ አርአተን ጀላ ነ ባስ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እሳን አከ መሌ ነት ጭመኒሩቲ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"አከ አን መቃኬ ገለቴፈዹፍ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ሉቡኮ መነ ህዻቲ ና ባስ።","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ሰበቢ አት ዋን ጋሪ ና ጎቴፍ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ቀጄልቶትን ናኖኮት ወልት ቀበሙ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/142.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/143.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/141.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}